    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUGFIXER INO</strong> is a nostalgic adventure game/visual novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that takes you back to the classic command-selection style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a building by choosing actions one by one, all while enjoying FM synthesis music that evokes the PC-98 era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You embody Ino, a 'Bugfixer' operating within an agency that addresses 'Bugs'\u2014anomalous powers. Your current assignment: infiltrate and investigate a deserted suburban building. Expect a brief but engaging experience, with an estimated play time of one hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHARACTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825540/extras/81b6f8e3fbfef247f28ef409df3266a1.avif?t=1753788400\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Belongs to the BUGFIXER office &quot;BugsLife&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ino is a BUGFIXER who captures those who misuse the power \u201cBUG\u201d that is out of the providence of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825540/extras/af5924cc08790b2fee091975f85a38a4.avif?t=1753788400\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated operator to assist ino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She provides various advice through correspondence from the office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work has a short playtime of about one hour, but if sales go well, I'd like to create a longer game. Please support us by purchasing and promoting it on social media.</p>",
